                           |GKBZEN FISHING
|YK0================================================================

|YKB'Give a man a fish, feed him a day. Teach a man to fish, feed
him for the rest of his life.'|WKO - |RKBAncient Proverb|YK0

A Monk should not be reliant on commerce and economy for the
basic needs in life. Zen Fishing is the art of throwing a line
into the water and willing large fish in the area to offer
themselves for the Monk's nourishment. A fishing rod is 
necessary in order to utilize this skill.
When you are finished you just need to |GKBReel|YKO the line in.

|GK0This is a Master of Autumn power.

